ET
BT
/F9 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
54. 736.8899999999999864 Td
(In conversational analysis, discourse markers serve three primary overarching functions: textual, interpersonal,) Tj
T* (and cognitive. Textual functions encompass topic management, turn-taking coordination, and sequential) Tj
T* (organization of complex arguments in ongoing discourse. Markers such as anyway or so signal closure of) Tj
T* (subordinate tangents and re-orient the conversational focus back to the core thematic agenda.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
54. 661.8899999999999864 Td
(Interpersonal functions regulate social distance, solidarity, and face management. By utilizing epistemic) Tj
T* (hedging markers like I mean and you know, speakers soften assertive declarations, thereby mitigating) Tj
T* (potential conflict and encouraging collaborative meaning negotiation.) Tj
ET
BT
/F10 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
54. 596.8899999999999864 Td
(2.4 Discourse Markers in L2 Learner Corpora) Tj
ET
