/F9 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.059 0.09 0.165 rg
54. 576.8899999999999864 Td
(Corpus-based studies \(e.g., Aijmer 2002, M¸ller 2005\) reveal notable discrepancies between native and) Tj
T* (non-native deployment of discourse markers. L2 speakers often exhibit overreliance on a narrow inventory of) Tj
T* (familiar markers while underutilizing subtle interactive hedges, often resulting from prescriptive classroom) Tj
T* (instruction that overlooks pragmatic discourse routines.) Tj
ET
